{"name":"Gingersnap","hex":"#c79e73","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"gingersnap","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A type of biscuit or cookie made from dough seasoned with ginger.","A hot-tempered person, particularly one who is red-haired."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/gingersnap"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ginger snap","blocks":[{"text":"A gingersnap, ginger snap, ginger nut, or ginger biscuit is a biscuit flavoured with ginger. Ginger snaps are flavoured with powdered ginger and a variety of other spices, most commonly cinnamon, molasses and clove. There are many recipes. The brittle ginger nut style is a commercial version of the traditional fairings once made for market fairs now represented only by the Cornish fairing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Arnott%27s_Ginger_Nut_04.jpg/330px-Arnott%27s_Ginger_Nut_04.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ginger_snap","wikidata":"Q7879663"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg/500px-Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg/500px-Freshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Northern European-style ginger nuts","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFreshly_baked_gingerbread_-_Christmas_2004.jpg"}],"sounds":{"gingersnap":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-gingersnap.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcode